    "blurb": "Reliable document AI for process orchestration",
    "overview": "Transform unstructured documents into accurate, structured data, while Camunda orchestrates decisions and routes work across systems and teams. Deliver scalable, end-to-end automation for document-centric processes such as claims handling, onboarding, financial operations, compliance, and customer service.",
    "rating": null,
